:15px 20px;font-size:13px;line-height:18px;border-radius:4px;box-shadow:0 3px 6px #0006;z-index:55557!important;background-color:#fff}.rich-text .actions{margin-top:32px!important;margin-bottom:32px!important}.rich-text a.button{text-decoration:none!important}\\u0040media (min-width: 768px){.rich-text img{display:inline-block!important;padding:0;vertical-align:middle;max-width:276px}.rich-text img.small{max-width:254px!important}.rich-text img.medium{max-width:378px!important}.rich-text img.large{max-width:480px!important}.rich-text img.full{max-width:100\\u0025!important}.rich-text img.center{display:block!important;margin:0 auto}.rich-text img.half{max-width:354px;max-height:none!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third{max-width:250px!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third:first-child,.rich-text img.half:first-child{margin-left:0}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type{float:none}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type:after,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type:after{content:\\\".\\\";display:block;height:0;clear:both;visibility:hidden}}\\u0040media (max-width: 767px){.rich-text img{max-width:100\\u0025}}.rich-text-section+.rich-text-section{margin-top:75px}.rich-text-section_title h1,.rich-text-section_title h2,.rich-text-section_title h3,.rich-text-section_title h4,.rich-text-section_title h5,.rich-text-section_title h6{margin-bottom:.8em!important}\\nimg{max-width:280px}.small{max-width:240px}.medium{max-width:320px}.large{max-width:360px}\\u003C/style>\\u003C/head>\\u003Cbody dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"_8isn _agix x1 Locale_en_US\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8isn\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iso\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iu9\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"rich-text\\\">\\u003Ch1>How to link a device \\u003C/h1>\\u003Cblockquote>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"mvm uiP fsm\\\">There is a known issue for some linked devices not displaying up to one year of chat history. We're working to fix this as soon as possible. In the meantime, you can still see your chat history on your primary device. We encourage you to keep WhatsApp updated on your linked device. Updates are released regularly and may contain fixes for bugs and other issues. \\u003C/div>\\u003C/blockquote>\\u003Cp>You can now use the same WhatsApp account on multiple devices at the same time, using your primary phone to link up to four devices. You&rsquo;ll need to log in to WhatsApp on your primary phone every 14 days to keep linked devices connected to your WhatsApp account.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>Linking your device\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>\\u003C/p>\\u003Cdiv style=\\\"position:relative; overflow:hidden; width: 100\\u0025;padding-top: 56.25\\u0025;\\\">\\u003Ciframe src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_video/1873919526750742/?video_locale=en_US&amp;thumbnail_timestamp_ms=1000\\\" style=\\\"position:absolute; top:0; left:0; bottom:0; right:0; width:100\\u0025; height:100\\u0025;\\\" frameborder=\\\"0\\\" allowfullscreen=\\\"1\\\">\\u003C/iframe>\\u003C/div>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Open WhatsApp on your Android primary phone.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Tap \\u003Cinline-margin>\\u003C/inline-margin>\\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-more&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\"More (three vertical dots)\\\"> &gt; \\u003Cb>Linked devices\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Link a device\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If prompted, verify your identity on your primary phone:\\u003C/li>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>If your device has biometric authentication, follow the on-screen instructions.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If you don&rsquo;t have biometric authentication enabled, you&rsquo;ll be prompted to enter the PIN you use to unlock your phone. \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cli>Point your primary phone at the screen of the device you want to link to, and scan the QR code.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: If we detect an unrecognized device, we&rsquo;ll ask you to confirm that you want to link this device. Tap \\u003Cb>Don&rsquo;t link\\u003C/b> if you don&rsquo;t want to link the device, and tap \\u003Cb>Link device\\u003C/b> to link the device.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>Related resources\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"http://faq.whatsapp.com/1324084875126592\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">link a device with phone number\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/378279804439436\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">linked devices\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/834124628020911\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">unlink a device\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_a0jc\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_aini\\\">Does this answer your question?\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_ainj\\\">\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfYqVjhjzy_qdyqMRE4LLQZnHfuPRIemr7i_NiUzNz-wQhDzQaDofsPML99cldJD2aPbcm4AwWyCzzg8yzXV0ne4AJ9meoHSSsOs1SQmsiK5MJUoIJGTkSP3MKauRHymE2YwXbmfbMo4YmwvaVdn9KN_-OEVTi4KEvW1A8aROJCbN0k\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Yes\\u003C/a>\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=Afb6Hy-E0qtOAI6TwJaL_4F35giCeqqeTFrUB-E5TXt78ge2dm4WBpjSiGi0iThcbwPagwq1pjkW2wD6MymnJjsi2px8uBszRhlTCnaWsa6Uh2oePyTydI3jih0gY89X5mr4OX2OtNTLU6CEdznchKIZZFK-x0Pq9Lmj6bWeFlScCg\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">No\\u003C/a>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cimg src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback_pixel.png?enc=AfY3peojV8h7LvaQzJugBrdXZwsvQ_XDT4ZH39qqebwuQZsg4QF_5H_K4-CP-wUwTO3FVNwz3MbroehKSE5x3bNwaKiMV-5EfcU1jbsBlz4aYZoOFo9mCadeU_meyJEVpuY637B-dBBWl7Muwvj66tRxvROTIvyAZAEBzpdUN7V9qw\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/body>\\u003C/html>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"About disappearing messages\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/673193694148537/?cms_id=/673193694148537\",\"id