ontent:\\\".\\\";display:block;height:0;clear:both;visibility:hidden}}\\u0040media (max-width: 767px){.rich-text img{max-width:100\\u0025}}.rich-text-section+.rich-text-section{margin-top:75px}.rich-text-section_title h1,.rich-text-section_title h2,.rich-text-section_title h3,.rich-text-section_title h4,.rich-text-section_title h5,.rich-text-section_title h6{margin-bottom:.8em!important}\\nimg{max-width:280px}.small{max-width:240px}.medium{max-width:320px}.large{max-width:360px}\\u003C/style>\\u003C/head>\\u003Cbody dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"_8isn _agix x1 Locale_en_US\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8isn\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iso\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iu9\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"rich-text\\\">\\u003Ch1>About disappearing messages\\u003C/h1>\\u003Cp style=\\\"text-align:center\\\">\\u003Cimg class=\\\"full _-q6\\\" id=\\\"\\\" src=\\\"https://scontent.whatsapp.net/v/t39.8562-34/420080500_913550250116136_4560273446204165335_n.png?ccb=1-7&amp;_nc_sid=73b08c&amp;_nc_ohc=4_xqPrcQR44Q7kNvwFvhXFY&amp;_nc_oc=Adr7-rDN3CUP7Oao0bueRQhRMTgcRKTHYsyTXUZFMYp3-OR8s4PMtAQxBHkI4DjxL0o&amp;_nc_zt=3&amp;_nc_ht=scontent.whatsapp.net&amp;_nc_gid=8JjC4vUZheMu9YEupGhRdQ&amp;_nc_ss=7839b&amp;oh=01_Q5Aa4wF89LYoYlTRnVzi3Zil1VtPjACzKb7ue9COpurvknpjUA&amp;oe=6A485B79\\\" style=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Disappearing messages is an optional feature you can turn on for more privacy. \\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>You can set messages to disappear 24 hours, 7 days, or 90 days after they&rsquo;re sent unless that message is kept. The duration you choose only affects new messages in the chat, not messages you&rsquo;ve already sent or received. \\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>How to use disappearing messages \\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>You can choose to turn disappearing messages on for all chats or select specific chats. In individual chats, either you or the person you&rsquo;re messaging can turn disappearing messages on or off. Learn how to turn disappearing messages on or off in this \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/5590979194321336\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">help article\\u003C/a>.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Anyone can turn disappearing messages on or off in group chats by default. But, group admins can change group settings to allow only admins to do this. Learn how to turn disappearing messages on or off in a group in this \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/515705483748188\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">help article\\u003C/a>.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>You can set disappearing messages as default for new individual chats by tapping \\u003Cb>Settings\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Privacy\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Default message timer\\u003C/b> and selecting a duration. \\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>:\\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>\\u003Cb>You can set messages to disappear after 24 hours, 7 days, or 90 days.\\u003C/b>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Disappearing messages disappear for both senders and recipients, including messages you send to yourself. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>After the disappearing messages setting is enabled for a group chat, new messages will disappear. Messages sent before the settings change are unaffected. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If you don&rsquo;t open WhatsApp within the time you set messages to disappear, the message will disappear from the chat. But the message preview might still be displayed until the person you&rsquo;re messaging opens WhatsApp. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If a disappearing message is forwarded to a chat with disappearing messages off, the message won&rsquo;t disappear in the forwarded chat. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>When you reply to a message on WhatsApp, the original message is quoted in your response. If you have disappearing messages turned on, the quoted message might still be visible in the chat after the duration limit has passed. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If a user creates a backup before a message disappears, the disappeared message will be included in the backup. Disappearing messages will be deleted when a user restores from a backup. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Disappearing messages aren&rsquo;t available in certain countries for payment or order-related messages. You can still delete these messages from your own chat history individually. \\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Ch3>About kept messages\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>Anyone in a group chat can keep disappearing messages to stop them from disappearing as long as the set duration time hasn&rsquo;t passed. \\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>A kept message will be visible to everyone in the conversation and won&rsquo;t disappear when its duration expires.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>The message sender has ultimate control over who can keep it. If someone keeps a message you've sent, you'll get a notification. If you decide to unkeep the message, no one else in the chat can keep it again.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>You&rsquo;ll have approximately 30 days to unkeep a message from the time it was kept.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>Learn more about \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/728928448599090\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">kept messages\\u003C/a>. \\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>Media in disappearing messages\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>By default, any media you download in WhatsApp will be automatically saved to your photos. But if disappearing messages are turned on, media sent in a chat will disappear and won't be saved to your photos. \\u003C/p>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_a0jc\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_aini\\\">Does this answer your question?\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_ainj\\\">\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfYP-tQEb_bsTnnYU1hGx2lMVzPgZ-BxKZttUxvsKuI143aeoHuGb08IChYdpF_Z6Nm_TJKYdHmVowe6NiLzUJK5mP96otMXHCm8kKRs0C8cCzi9ZeU6kNACqtVK0qX6c8-WEkCgOl7nI_xgs7G54UV1eEQWY2NxEWKf_jPlEovl3Q\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Yes\\u003C/a>\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=Afb_JclXHjYtZMR2cHmUisXMUGlx4L49Nm-0tnTa0I0G-DqNVOBAXe9IMhVoGncj4eXAt95Aha-Ofn_5NY3c2u5T-0lo3wx0PGNMEGOMRIVx4nf5LzqgkvXNW6q3RPEL3AMOikWeHYPVqzhhR5-AICbmIQWEzjAIH1lp1tfSLTQV\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">No\\u003C/a>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cimg src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback_pixel.png?enc=AfYSVCK6QhaZ5g6ToY0jl_b8o8Yu11MTJOK5Qv6Xki93l5kjviGeZfrfK3hV10PmZgdGID31gMd4nKqafrPbkab85TaLXHgH9lhWQzp8WGfcdhPq4kPMdsbubuarpWKIR0o1olByfpJwryCc73t17iQoSHmpubJUnPzoh7S6m0Re\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/body>\\u003C/html>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"About advanced chat privacy\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/715385484388016/?cms_id=/715385484388016\",\"id\":\"715385484388016\",\"description\":\"\\u003C!DOCTYPE html>\\n\\u003Chtml lang=\\\"en\\\" id=\\\"facebook\\\" class=\\\"no_js\\\">\\n\\u003Chead>\\u003Cmeta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"referrer\\\" content=\\\"default\\\" id=\\\"meta_referrer\\\">\\u003Cscript nonce=\\\"W2BHPmDR\\\">__DEV__=0;\\u003C/script>\\u003Ctitle>Facebook\\u003C/title>\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, minimum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\\\">\\u003Cstyle>html{touch-action:manipulation}body{background:#fff;color:#1c1e21;direction:ltr;line-height:1.34;margin:0;padding:0;unicode-bidi:embed}body,button,input,label,select,td,textarea{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px}h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{color:#1c1e21;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0;padding:0}h1{font-size:14px}h4,h5,h6{font-size:12px}p{margin:1em 0}b,strong{font-weight:600}a{color:#385898;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}button{margin:0}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}img{border:0px}td,td.label{text-align:left}dd{color:#000}dt{color:#606770}ul{list-style-type:none;margin:0;padding:0}abbr{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:none}hr{background:#dadde1;border-width:0;color:#dadde1;height:1px}\\n._8isn{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,Segoe UI,Roboto,Oxygen,Ubuntu,Cantarell,Open Sans,Helvetica Neue,sans-serif;margin:0;padding:0;text-rendering:optim