g.medium{max-width:378px!important}.rich-text img.large{max-width:480px!important}.rich-text img.full{max-width:100\\u0025!important}.rich-text img.center{display:block!important;margin:0 auto}.rich-text img.half{max-width:354px;max-height:none!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third{max-width:250px!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third:first-child,.rich-text img.half:first-child{margin-left:0}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type{float:none}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type:after,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type:after{content:\\\".\\\";display:block;height:0;clear:both;visibility:hidden}}\\u0040media (max-width: 767px){.rich-text img{max-width:100\\u0025}}.rich-text-section+.rich-text-section{margin-top:75px}.rich-text-section_title h1,.rich-text-section_title h2,.rich-text-section_title h3,.rich-text-section_title h4,.rich-text-section_title h5,.rich-text-section_title h6{margin-bottom:.8em!important}\\nimg{max-width:280px}.small{max-width:240px}.medium{max-width:320px}.large{max-width:360px}\\u003C/style>\\u003C/head>\\u003Cbody dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"_8isn _agix x1 Locale_en_US\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8isn\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iso\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iu9\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"rich-text\\\">\\u003Ch1>About advanced chat privacy\\u003C/h1>\\u003Cp>You can limit how other users can share your messages and media outside of WhatsApp. In group chats, group admins can enable Advanced Chat Privacy. In individual chats, either participant can enable Advanced Chat Privacy. When \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b> is enabled for a chat, people in the chat: \\u003C/p>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>Can&rsquo;t save media to their device gallery automatically.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Can't ask Meta AI to answer questions, or to create images or summaries in this chat.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Can&rsquo;t export the chat.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cp>Participants in the chat must enable \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b> for each individual or group chat you want to apply this setting to. Once it&rsquo;s turned on, \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b> applies to all messages in the chat. In group chats, group admins can enable Advanced Chat Privacy. In individual chats, either participant can enable Advanced Chat Privacy.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cblockquote>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: All chats are private by default. Your personal messages are always protected with end-to-end encryption.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>Meta AI can&rsquo;t access your chats. It can only read the messages people choose to send it, nothing else. This is true whether Advanced chat privacy is on or off. \\u003C/p>\\u003C/blockquote>\\u003Ch3>Enable or disable advanced chat privacy for individual chats\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>Anyone in the chat can turn this setting on or off.\\u003C/p>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Tap the chat you want to edit. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Tap \\u003Cinline-margin>\\u003C/inline-margin>\\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-more&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\" More (three vertical dots)\\\"> &gt; \\u003Cb>View contact\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b>. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Turn on or off \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Ch3>Enable or disable advanced chat privacy for groups\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cp>This setting applies to every member of the group. Group admins can update this setting.\\u003C/p>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Tap the chat you want to edit. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Tap \\u003Cinline-margin>\\u003C/inline-margin>\\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-more&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\" More (three vertical dots)\\\"> &gt; \\u003Cb>Group info\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Group permissions\\u003C/b>. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Turn on \\u003Cb>Edit group settings\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Go back to the Group info page and tap \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Turn on or off \\u003Cb>Advanced chat privacy\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: \\u003C/p>\\u003Cli>Users who aren&rsquo;t on the latest version of WhatsApp may still be able to share chats outside of WhatsApp, like auto-downloading media. When enabling this feature, you won&rsquo;t be notified if someone in the chat isn&rsquo;t on the latest version of WhatsApp. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Advanced chat privacy isn&rsquo;t available in chats with businesses that choose to use WhatsApp's parent company, Meta, to securely store messages and respond to customers on its behalf.  Learn more in \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1148840052398648?helpref=inline\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">this article\\u003C/a>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Ch3>Related resources\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/3307102709559968?helpref=rr\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">change your privacy settings\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1131457590844955?helpref=faq_content\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">change group privacy settings\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/2257017191175152?helpref=rr\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Meta AI\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_a0jc\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_aini\\\">Does this answer your question?\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_ainj\\\">\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfYZ_hUsrtqEZQRen5O8uaAsbXTfSiq7vyFmKmp58_tWue5pl4ZiSP4qKUgmawlBVP4JD310an2lEKQXB-4VhxJ60x6HwP3gjhqLmykipLouGpa9Zpa5jkOnV4D9yFPPd2ZdKJlKynFIxVe1MJT4GH-RvBam-Wp9eOl7xpyjiV67aA\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Yes\\u003C/a>\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=Afbci7P--NE3BzDk7YgUmQyi8Sa6lr2nadEinJNE8w6r2WwSWQKfmY8GYS-TA28B1nACAVyyRfgwgpiuw1m_XnJstKFHjy2vGvkVCuDqOm0vA5pPiDQWRsbzmLLWVsvsuKX_6A_Sva-KY8qfatj3hIaeB04ohx8lRIVCucxq6kBy\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">No\\u003C/a>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cimg src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback_pixel.png?enc=AfahKsRJVME21U5xc7NgeQXFjqHuuzmawcR54NQDvMukVUBC0JStIasa2aIbrjtKrXzr2Soa5tO05LbRo-U7L2YV5sDCgZ7MxWZP_zleK-MeQSN0m0GFogNYmbFB1Icc8uaCV7ZKNtWlple7h55cTOI4F-noC6dx34AB1HFHcWkN\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/body>\\u003C/html>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"About unofficial apps\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1217634902127718/?cms_id=/1217634902127718\",\"id\":\"1217634902127718\",\"description\":\"\\u003C!DOCTYPE html>\\n\\u003Chtml lang=\\\"en\\\" id=\\\"facebook\\\" class=\\\"no_js\\\">\\n\\u003Chead>\\u003Cmeta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"referrer\\\" content=\\\"default\\\" id=\\\"meta_referrer\\\">\\u003Cscript nonce=\\\"W2BHPmDR\\\">__DEV__=0;\\u003C/script>\\u003Ctitle>Facebook\\u003C/title>\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, minimum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\\\">\\u003Cstyle>html{touch-action:manipulation}body{background:#fff;color:#1c1e21;direction:ltr;line-height:1.34;margin:0;padding:0;unicode-bidi:embed}body,button,input,label,select,td,textarea{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px}h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{color:#1c1e21;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0;padding:0}h1{font-size:14px}h4,h5,h6{font-size:12px}p{margin:1em 0}b,strong{font-weight:600}a{color:#385898;cursor:pointer;text-decoration:none}button{margin:0}a:hover{text-decoration:underline}img{border:0px}td,td.label{text-align:left}dd{color:#000}dt{color:#606770}ul{list-style-type:none;margin:0;padding:0}abbr{border-bottom:none;text-decoration:none}hr{background:#dadde1;border-width:0;color:#dadde1;height:1px}\\n._8isn{fo