s{margin-top:32px!important;margin-bottom:32px!important}.rich-text a.button{text-decoration:none!important}\\u0040media (min-width: 768px){.rich-text img{display:inline-block!important;padding:0;vertical-align:middle;max-width:276px}.rich-text img.small{max-width:254px!important}.rich-text img.medium{max-width:378px!important}.rich-text img.large{max-width:480px!important}.rich-text img.full{max-width:100\\u0025!important}.rich-text img.center{display:block!important;margin:0 auto}.rich-text img.half{max-width:354px;max-height:none!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third{max-width:250px!important;margin-left:12px;float:left}.rich-text img.third:first-child,.rich-text img.half:first-child{margin-left:0}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type{float:none}.rich-text img.half:last-of-type:after,.rich-text img.third:last-of-type:after{content:\\\".\\\";display:block;height:0;clear:both;visibility:hidden}}\\u0040media (max-width: 767px){.rich-text img{max-width:100\\u0025}}.rich-text-section+.rich-text-section{margin-top:75px}.rich-text-section_title h1,.rich-text-section_title h2,.rich-text-section_title h3,.rich-text-section_title h4,.rich-text-section_title h5,.rich-text-section_title h6{margin-bottom:.8em!important}\\nimg{max-width:280px}.small{max-width:240px}.medium{max-width:320px}.large{max-width:360px}\\u003C/style>\\u003C/head>\\u003Cbody dir=\\\"ltr\\\" class=\\\"_8isn _agix x1 Locale_en_US\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8isn\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iso\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_8iu9\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"rich-text\\\">\\u003Ch1>How to link a device with phone number \\u003C/h1>\\u003Cp>You can link a device using your primary account phone number and a one-time code. Up to four linked devices can be linked without the need to keep your primary phone connected to WhatsApp. You'll need to log in to WhatsApp on your primary phone every 14 days to keep linked devices connected to your WhatsApp account. For the best experience, update to the latest version of WhatsApp on all devices.\\u003C/p>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: This feature is currently only available on WhatsApp for Windows and WhatsApp Web.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch5>On WhatsApp for Windows or WhatsApp Web\\u003C/h5>\\u003Cbr>\\u003Cp>To begin linking a companion device using your phone number, open Whatsapp for Windows or \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://web.whatsapp.com/\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">\\u003Cb>WhatsApp Web\\u003C/b>\\u003C/a> on the device you want to link.\\u003C/p>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Click \\u003Cb>Link with phone number\\u003C/b> or \\u003Cb>Log in with phone number\\u003C/b>. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Select your country and enter your primary account phone number, then click \\u003Cb>Next\\u003C/b>. (\\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1294841057948784\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Learn how to use international phone number format\\u003C/a>.)\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>You'll see an eight-character code on the screen.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Ch5>On your primary phone\\u003C/h5>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Tap the \\u003Cb>Enter code\\u003C/b> to link new device notification from WhatsApp. \\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Your primary phone will show the location and name of the device you're trying to link. If this is correct, tap \\u003Cb>Confirm\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If prompted, verify your identity.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>If your device has biometric authentication, follow the on-screen instructions.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>If you don't have biometric authentication enabled, you'll be prompted to enter the PIN you use to unlock your phone.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003Cli>Enter the eight-character code from your companion device on your primary phone.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: If we detect an unrecognized device, we&rsquo;ll ask you to confirm that you want to link this device. Tap \\u003Cb>Don&rsquo;t link\\u003C/b> if you don&rsquo;t want to link the device, and tap \\u003Cb>Link device\\u003C/b> to link the device.\\u003C/p>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cp>Alternatively, you can directly link companion devices to your primary phone using the following steps:\\u003C/p>\\u003Col>\\u003Cli>Open WhatsApp on your primary Android phone.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Tap \\u003Cimg class=\\\"img\\\" src=\\\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/assets/?set=whatsapp_help_article_assets&amp;name=android-more&amp;density=1\\\" width=\\\"25\\\" height=\\\"25\\\" alt=\\\"More (three vertical dots)\\\"> &gt; \\u003Cb>Linked devices\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Link a device\\u003C/b> &gt; \\u003Cb>Link with phone number instead\\u003C/b>.\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>Enter the eight-character code from your companion device on your primary phone.\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ol>\\u003Cp>\\u003Cb>Note\\u003C/b>: If we detect an unrecognized device, we&rsquo;ll ask you to confirm that you want to link this device. Tap \\u003Cb>Don&rsquo;t link\\u003C/b> if you don&rsquo;t want to link the device, and tap \\u003Cb>Link device\\u003C/b> to link the device.\\u003C/p>\\u003Ch3>Related resources\\u003C/h3>\\u003Cul>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1317564962315842\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">link a device with QR code\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/378279804439436\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">linked devices\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/668538004658079\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">WhatsApp Web and Desktop\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>How to \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/834124628020911\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">log out\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003Cli>About \\u003Ca href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/1197347060992858/?cms_platform=android\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\"> changing phones\\u003C/a>\\u003C/li>\\u003C/ul>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_a0jc\\\">\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_aini\\\">Does this answer your question?\\u003C/div>\\u003Cdiv class=\\\"_ainj\\\">\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfaLl5YBfneGiqsXOJG1lBzVMaMBwvyxV_LCop8Lnt9VHVkaUJJUUks3X6xXC2gj8ihL6bThyDZaY05gFfh0PhfxW87DEBZCG2vpDmkln1TNO2uSG5gIhETTaagYaLV3XS1LdAYEuQNZtvNp9IGLl1r_ycDNLJsbvncp7ziRmk-F4Zw\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">Yes\\u003C/a>\\u003Ca class=\\\"_aink\\\" href=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback/?enc=AfaL1LyXv59wssQTGYmWlLmvIgYw0AQ5r_o84q4vc3ON6ETk3Y4D9tKiLjYEC8tDoYv5K-vUpf9KarjQ0J_kgKnJ6PTkKrTHTyavXjWYhu1yisGng_Su99nZiLKUR180PoIDKHBi8-tP6lDgUGZq-2RA6TSQVCFc7W8zkG_uRVdKBg\\\" data-lnfb-mode=\\\"ie\\\">No\\u003C/a>\\u003C/div>\\u003Cimg src=\\\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/client_search_feedback_pixel.png?enc=AfacgdnbMjt2m2Y_764BfmHGFm0Az8_Qo9YxsTy41A1rMbqXIPYXpgNMt04ziusSj10odjq5tSrwwDWElH2wxyYegEiGOx98MTHHrmf4CTgFscbFTRoKgRhXC9Fhw98LgAPNMYRIX8QAcRC6xIoIa7oYkLh9wosHuR6VFi5-XAoexQ\\\" alt=\\\"\\\">\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/div>\\u003C/body>\\u003C/html>\\n\"},{\"title\":\"About safely communicating with WhatsApp Support\",\"lang\":\"en\",\"url\":\"https://faq.whatsapp.com/854037192262196/?cms_id=/854037192262196\",\"id\":\"854037192262196\",\"description\":\"\\u003C!DOCTYPE html>\\n\\u003Chtml lang=\\\"en\\\" id=\\\"facebook\\\" class=\\\"no_js\\\">\\n\\u003Chead>\\u003Cmeta charset=\\\"utf-8\\\">\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"referrer\\\" content=\\\"default\\\" id=\\\"meta_referrer\\\">\\u003Cscript nonce=\\\"W2BHPmDR\\\">__DEV__=0;\\u003C/script>\\u003Ctitle>Facebook\\u003C/title>\\u003Cmeta name=\\\"viewport\\\" content=\\\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, minimum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\\\">\\u003Cstyle>html{touch-action:manipulation}body{background:#fff;color:#1c1e21;direction:ltr;line-height:1.34;margin:0;padding:0;unicode-bidi:embed}body,button,input,label,select,td,textarea{font-family:Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:12px}h1,h2,h3,h4,h5,h6{color:#1c1e21;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;margin:0;padding:0}h1{font-size:14px}h4,h5,h6{font-size:12px}p{margin:1em 0}